OL,3,ATrump chief of staff Susie Wiles
OL,4,Aannounces she's cancer-free
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhite House Chief of Staff Susie Wiles
OL,7,Fhas announced she is free of cancer,
OL,8,Fexactly six months after she announced
OL,9,Fher diagnosis.
OL,11,FIn a post on X, Wiles said her
OL,12,Fpathology tests "came back clear" after
OL,13,Fa visit to the Mayo Clinic earlier this
OL,14,Fweek.
OL,16,FWiles, 69, is considered among the most
OL,17,Fpowerful figures in the Trump
OL,18,Fadministration and someone particularly
OL,19,Fclose to the US president.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
